## Docker
{% if full %}
Everything runs in containers. The `dev` service mounts this folder and keeps `vendor/` and `node_modules/` in Docker volumes:

```sh
docker compose up dev                              # development with hot reload
docker compose run --rm dev composer check         # any command in the dev container
docker compose up --build app                      # production container on http://localhost:{{ ports.APP_PORT }}
docker compose --profile dev down                  # stop everything; add -v to also delete the volumes
```
{% else %}
```sh
docker compose up --build   # build the image and run the app on http://localhost:{{ ports.APP_PORT }}
docker compose logs -f      # follow the logs
docker compose down         # stop; add -v to also delete the data volume
```
{% endif %}
The production image runs [FrankenPHP](https://frankenphp.dev) with PHP 8.5 as a non-root user, serves the built assets and applies migrations on start. {% if choices.database == "sqlite" %}The SQLite database{% else %}The {{ dbname }} data{% endif %} is stored {% if choices.data == "local" %}in the project's `data/` folder (`DOCKER_DATA=./data`){% else %}in the Docker volume `data` (`DOCKER_DATA=data`){% endif %}; change `DOCKER_DATA` in `.env` to switch.
{%- endif %}

